   "text": "azure_probe.py: read-only probes of Foundry, APIM, the\nMCP servers, data, Monitor, Sentinel, Policy, Defender,\nEntra and more. Each result is cached 120 s. Feeds the\nControl Room and 'Prove it's real'.",
