   "text": "agent_run.py: one Foundry agent turn in a child process,\none JSON event per line. Approval requests go to the\nbrowser. Enters at the APIM /agents front door once it is\ndeployed, else direct; the legacy PoC agent always goes\ndirect.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d12_0051",
   "originalText": "agent_run.py: one Foundry agent turn in a child process,\none JSON event per line. Approval requests go to the\nbrowser. Enters at the APIM /agents front door once it is\ndeployed, else direct; the legacy PoC agent always goes\ndirect.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
