   "text": "Browser at http://127.0.0.1:<port>/ (the\ndefault browser on the laptop, Edge on\nthe jump box). Plain JavaScript, no CDN.\nPages: Start, Acts 1-5, Act 6 boards, Act\n7 roles and cost, Control Room,\nScoreboard. A strip lights up the layers a\njob touches.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
