   "text": "Credentials, local only. The operator's az\nlogin cache gives silent tokens for ARM,\nGraph, Log Analytics, Foundry and the\nMCP APIs. .secrets\\msal-test-<id>.json\nholds one device-code sign-in per\npersona (an MSAL cache: the refresh\ntoken plus short-lived access tokens).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
