   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Stage (laptop): Deploy-JumpBox-Console.bat runs\nscripts\\jumpbox-console.ps1, which builds a\nwhitelist package: the console, the agent and demo\ncode, the policy XML, the KQL and Sentinel packs,\nthe generated infra JSON (resource names and ids,\nno keys) and the scrubbed evidence. It scans the\npackage for secrets before anything is sent.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d12_0146",
   "originalText": "Stage (laptop): Deploy-JumpBox-Console.bat runs\nscripts\\jumpbox-console.ps1, which builds a\nwhitelist package: the console, the agent and demo\ncode, the policy XML, the KQL and Sentinel packs,\nthe generated infra JSON (resource names and ids,\nno keys) and the scrubbed evidence. It scans the\npackage for secrets before anything is sent.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
