   "text": "Start (laptop): starts the VM if it is stopped, then\nreads the state of C:\\abw on it with one Azure\nrun-command probe. Safe to re-run.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
