   "text": "Verify: a throw-away console on port 8799 (health,\nUI, catalog, scoreboard, policy, personas), private\nDNS, an unauthenticated APIM call and a silent\nsign-in check for each persona already on the VM.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "d12_0158",
   "originalText": "Verify: a throw-away console on port 8799 (health,\nUI, catalog, scoreboard, policy, personas), private\nDNS, an unauthenticated APIM call and a silent\nsign-in check for each persona already on the VM.",
