   "text": "In the VM, each phase is one Azure run-command call (as SYSTEM, in Windows PowerShell 5.1) that returns one JSON line. The first failing phase stops the run, and every phase can be repeated.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "In the VM, each phase is one Azure run-command call (as SYSTEM, in Windows PowerShell 5.1) that returns one JSON line. The first failing phase stops the run, and every phase can be repeated.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d12_0175",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 1859.5,
   "width": 127.84,
   "height": 25.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
