   "originalText": "What to notice",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d12_0176",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 76.0,
   "y": 1892.5,
   "width": 825.86,
   "height": 180.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp12_002"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2593780,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18432460,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "- No token, password or TOTP seed is printed or sent to the browser. Every token comes from the\n  operator's az login or a persona's own device-code sign-in. The server listens on 127.0.0.1 only and\n  refuses cross-origin POSTs.\n- Every board row carries an evidence tag, so observed facts are never mixed up with replayed or\n  portal-only ones. The jump box holds only the scrubbed copy of the evidence.\n- The Act 6 and Act 7 boards change nothing in Entra except 6.1's real failed sign-ins for one demo user\n  (at most five in ten minutes). Act 7 changes only the two front-door named values and restores them;\n  Reset demo restores the baseline: kill switch, allow-list, limits and the operator's roles.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "- No token, password or TOTP seed is printed or sent to the browser. Every token comes from the\n  operator's az login or a persona's own device-code sign-in. The server listens on 127.0.0.1 only and\n  refuses cross-origin POSTs.\n- Every board row carries an evidence tag, so observed facts are never mixed up with replayed or\n  portal-only ones. The jump box holds only the scrubbed copy of the evidence.\n- The Act 6 and Act 7 boards change nothing in Entra except 6.1's real failed sign-ins for one demo user\n  (at most five in ten minutes). Act 7 changes only the two front-door named values and restores them;\n  Reset demo restores the baseline: kill switch, allow-list, limits and the operator's roles.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d12_0178",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 1859.5,
