  },
  {
   "id": "d12_0179",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 966.0,
   "y": 1892.5,
   "width": 649.28,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp12_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2617537,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18746647,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. The presenter presses a beat button in the browser.\n2. The browser sends POST /api/jobs to 127.0.0.1. The server refuses it unless it is\n    same-origin.\n3. jobs.py starts the job in its own thread. Scripts and agent turns run as child processes.\n4. The job runs the beat through a module: catalog, probe, e2e, act7, agent_run or a helper.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "1. The presenter presses a beat button in the browser.\n2. The browser sends POST /api/jobs to 127.0.0.1. The server refuses it unless it is\n    same-origin.\n3. jobs.py starts the job in its own thread. Scripts and agent turns run as child processes.\n4. The job runs the beat through a module: catalog, probe, e2e, act7, agent_run or a helper.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "d12_0180",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1659.0,
   "y": 1892.5,
   "width": 652.74,
   "height": 100.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [
    "grp12_003"
   ],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 2625456,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 18851376,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1735689600000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "5. The module takes a token silently from the operator's az login, or from a persona's own\n    cache, and calls the target.\n6. The job emits plain-English events. The browser polls GET /api/jobs/{id}, draws the cards\n    and lights the strip. Each row carries an evidence tag: live, probe, logs, graph, arm, replay\n    or portal (Act 7 adds rbac and design).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "5. The module takes a token silently from the operator's az login, or from a persona's own\n    cache, and calls the target.\n6. The job emits plain-English events. The browser polls GET /api/jobs/{id}, draws the cards\n    and lights the strip. Each row carries an evidence tag: live, probe, logs, graph, arm, replay\n    or portal (Act 7 adds rbac and design).",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
